---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import meeting from '../assets/photos/trinity-research-presentation.png';
---
<div class="steel-research-photo">
  <h4>Research Translation</h4>
  <figure>
    <Image src={meeting} alt="PhD student Pyam Oveys discussing steel-market decision-support research beside a Trinity Products project poster." width={800} widths={[400,800]} format="webp" quality={90} sizes="(max-width: 700px) 90vw, 45vw" loading="lazy" />
    <figcaption>Pyam Oveys presenting the Trinity Products steel-market analytics project at the 2024 CELDi Research Symposium, where he earned first place in the poster competition. <a href="https://engineering.missouri.edu/2024/ph-d-student-earns-first-in-poster-competition-at-celdi-research-symposium/">Read the Mizzou Engineering story ↗</a></figcaption>
  </figure>
</div>
<style>
  .steel-research-photo { width:100%; margin-block:.5rem 1rem; }
  h4 { margin:0 0 .75rem; }
  figure { margin:0; }
  img { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border:1px solid var(--line); }
  figcaption { margin-top:.5rem; font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-600); }
</style>
